# Newsroom bot schedule (supercronic crontab format).
#
# This file is mounted into the bot-cron container as /app/crontab.
# Defaults below are sensible for most niches; the installer (M2) and
# admin Settings page (M5) rewrite these lines when the user changes
# schedule. supercronic re-reads on SIGHUP; the admin's cron-sync
# endpoint sends `docker compose restart bot-cron`.

# Fast ingestion — RSS sweep only (no clustering, no article generation)
*/5 * * * * python -m main_fast

# Full pipeline — ingestion + clustering + article generation
15,45 * * * * python -m main_full
